<title>USA: Jos. A Bank names Tworecke president.</title>
<headline>Jos. A Bank names Tworecke president.</headline>
<dateline>HAMPSTEAD, Md. 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jos. A. Bank Clothiers Inc said on Tuesday that Frank Tworecke has been promoted to president and chief merchandising officer, effective September 10, 1996.</p>
<p>Tworecke, who was previously executive vice president and chief merchandising officer, will report to Timothy Finley, who remains chief executive officer and chairman, the company said.</p>
<p>Finley previously held the president's title with his other titles, the company said.</p>
</text>
